      "text": "They that trust in their wealth, Ps. 49:6 (52:7). He that trusteth in his riches shall fall, Prov. 11:28. heart of her husband doth safely trust in her, Prov. 31:11. poor of his people shall trust in it, Isa. 14:32 (2 Ne. 24:32). shall be greatly ashamed, that trust in graven images, Isa. 42:17. For thou hast trusted in thy wickedness, Isa. 47:10. ye trust in lying words, Jer. 7:8. trust ye not in any brother, Jer. 9:4.",
